't use `Function` as a type. The `Function` type accepts any function-like value.\nIt provides no type safety when calling the function, which can be a common source of bugs.\nIt also accepts things like class declarations, which will throw at runtime as they will not be called with `new`.\nIf you are expecting the function to accept certain arguments, you should explicitly define the function shape.","Identifier","bannedTypeMessage",["844","845"],["846","847"],["848","849"],"'FieldDefinition' is defined but never used.",["850","851"],["852","853"],["854","855"],["856","857"],["858","859"],["860","861"],["862","863"],["864","865"],["866","867"],["868","869"],["870","871"],"'mode' is assigned a value but never used.","'Collections' is defined but never used.",["872","873"],"'special' is defined but never used. Allowed unused args must match /^_/u.","'prop' is defined but never used. Allowed unused args must match /^_/u.","'op' is defined but never used. Allowed unused args must match /^_/u.","'value' is defined but never used. Allowed unused args must match /^_/u.",["874","875"],["876","877"],["878","879"],["880","881"],["882","883"],["884","885"],"'T' is defined but never used.",["886","887"],["888","889"],"'input' is defined but never used. Allowed unused args must match /^_/u.","'context' is defined but never used. Allowed unused args must match /^_/u.",["890","891"],"@typescript-eslint/no-var-requires","Require statement not part of import statement.","CallExpression","noVarReqs",["892","893"],["894","895"],["896","897"],["898","899"],["900","901"],["902","903"],["904","905"],["906","907"],["908","909"],["910","911"],["912","913"],["914","915"],"'property' is defined but never used. Allowed unused args must match /^_/u.",["916","917"],["918","919"],["920","921"],{"messageId":"922","fix":"923","desc":"924"},{"messageId":"925","fix":"926","desc":"927"},{"messageId":"922","fix":"928","desc":"924"},{"messageId":"925","fix":"929","desc":"927"},{"messageId":"922","fix"